<x-legal-page title="Cookies" description="The storage MyHoursPay uses to keep your account working.">
<h2>Essential cookies</h2><p>MyHoursPay uses session and security cookies to sign you in, protect forms and remember your session. These are needed to provide the service and cannot be switched off through a consent setting. Your browser can block them, but sign-in and forms may then stop working.</p>
<h2>Your cookie choice</h2><p>We store your acknowledgement in this browser for up to six months. It contains a policy version and expiry date, not your work records. Clearing browser storage removes this preference.</p>
<h2>Optional cookies</h2><p>This version of MyHoursPay does not set optional analytics or advertising cookies. There are no optional cookie categories to enable. If this changes, we will ask before enabling technologies that require your consent.</p>
<h2>Other services</h2><p>Payments and calendar connections may take you to Stripe, Google or Microsoft. Their sites have their own cookie notices. Product email preferences are separate from cookie settings.</p>
